1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,400
God of Nations,

2
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:06,600
at thy feet:

3
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:13,400
in the bonds of love we meet,

4
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:20,500
Hear our voices, we entreat,

5
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:27,400
God defend our free land.

6
00:00:27,400 --> 00:00:34,800
Guard Pacific's triple star,

7
00:00:34,800 --> 00:00:42,000
from the shafts of strife and war,

8
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:50,500
Make her praises heard afar,

9
00:00:50,500 --> 00:00:51,500
God

10
00:00:51,500 --> 00:00:53,900
defend

11
00:00:53,900 --> 00:01:02,000
New Zealand!